   "description": "Each router that gets the reputation list (mikrotik.routers, roles including ip_reputation). They are reconciled in parallel, so one that is down or slow holds nobody back, and the tile at the top reads the worst of them: NO FIREWALL RULE if any router lacks a rule referencing the list. Done / To do is the progress of a reconcile in flight; Dropped is the referencing rules' own packet counter.",
